# Only needed locally if the backend isn't running at the default localhost:8080.
# Copy this file to .env and uncomment/edit if needed:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8080

# On Render: set VITE_API_BASE_URL as an environment variable in the Static Site's
# dashboard (Environment tab), pointing at your deployed backend's URL, e.g.
# https://simple-bank-backend.onrender.com - no trailing slash. Vite bakes this value
# in at BUILD time, not runtime, so Render must have it set *before* it runs the build -
# if you add/change it after the fact, trigger a manual redeploy to pick it up.
